The Verifier Set: code under the MIT licence (LICENSE), copyright Simon Gant.

- vendor/crystal/ is The Crystal (sjgant80-hub/the-crystal), MIT, copyright Simon Gant: its kernels byte for byte at
  the commit that sealed them, and inside them The Climb's (sjgant80-hub/the-climb), as The Crystal vendors them. Each
  is recorded with its hash in vendor/PROVENANCE.json.
- vendor/docdec/src/gate.mjs is DocDec's verifier gate (sjgant80-hub/docdecdemo), MIT, copyright Simon Gant, at the
  commit recorded in vendor/PROVENANCE.json. It makes no bond here: it is a reader the citation harness must catch.
- data/seed.json is derived from The Crystal's published sealed run (scripts/make-seed.mjs).
- The problems and their documents are made by code (src/tasks.mjs). No dataset is used. The parties to every
  document are named only by their roles, and nothing in them describes a real person or company.
- vendor/fonts/ holds Fraunces, Hanken Grotesk and JetBrains Mono (variable, latin), each under the SIL Open Font
  Licence 1.1; each folder carries its licence. They are served from this page so that no font host is called.
- The model is not part of this repository. The page fetches Llama 3.2 1B Instruct (Meta, Llama 3.2 Community Licence)
  from the MLC project's published build when the viewer presses the button, and runs it with WebLLM 0.2.79
  (Apache 2.0).
